I also found this issue in my LPA data-analyses with 1815 participants, 2 indicators, and 4 profiles.

--------
fit3 <- dateset %>%
  select(indicator1,  indicator2) %>%
  single_imputation() %>%
  scale() %>%
  estimate_profiles(4, models = 1) # change factors and models
